    ✔ generates BHK CNC pockets without spurious radius blockers (24945ms)
    ✔ preserves placement, footprints and pad nets while replacing the perimeter (13502ms)

  Native object contract
    ✔ keeps reference anchors available without growing board geometry
    ✔ rejects legacy input and unknown native properties without rewriting source

  Physical stacking
    ✔ stacks the screen above the MCU and leaves the battery on the case floor
    ✔ updates dependent heights without moving independently supported objects
    ✔ keeps stacked bodies clear while reporting an actual height overlap
    ✔ reports insufficient case height without resizing the enclosure
    ✔ rejects cycles and contradictory vertical drivers

  Editable native frames
    ✔ mirrors column members once and edits only the mirrored instance

  Native PCB adapter
    ✔ retains copper obstacles and physical PCB thickness

  Authored cluster envelopes and parts
    ✔ wraps separated keys within a cluster without filling between clusters
    ✔ inherits footprint definitions while overriding instance references and parameters

  Aligned outline bridges
    ✔ aligns a bridge to the shared top edge and follows layout movement
    ✔ aligns a bridge to the shared bottom edge and follows layout movement
    ✔ aligns a bridge to the shared left edge and follows layout movement
    ✔ aligns a bridge to the shared right edge and follows layout movement

  Mechanical sheet layers

