 Step File Name : blob.step(986 ents)  Write  Done

    ✔ exports an independent millimetre outline with a switch cutout
    ✔ fits compressed sheets in order within their shared gap
    ✔ keeps missing material surfaces local to that layer
    ✔ cuts intersecting components and mounts while leaving remote bodies alone
    ✔ exports mirrored PCB sheets in their own nominal millimetre frame
    ✔ reports interference without moving the stack or blocking other outputs

  Enclosure manufacturing checks
    ✔ measures a sharp pocket independently of its declared settings
    ✔ relieves sharp CNC pockets without shrinking their required opening
    ✔ measures relieved rotated corners independently of chain start and winding
    ✔ adapts small fillets and rotated openings to the actual cutter
    ✔ protects mounting contacts beside a CNC plate cutout
    ✔ checks posts only where their height overlaps cutter relief
    ✔ retains material around a nut pocket inside its own post
    ✔ rejects malformed process envelopes instead of silently passing them

  MakerJS
    ✔ disappearance
    ✔ weird combination

  Layout center guides
    ✔ places row guides through the bounds of mixed-size keycaps
    ✔ reflects splay in mirrored column guides
    ✔ uses a declared part center before its body envelope
    ✔ resolves physical centers and splayed column frames
    ✔ aligns a component to a rotated column without rotating the component
    ✔ moves the follower without pulling an unconstrained target
    ✔ follows an alignment chain after reload and rejects cycles

  Native layout constraints
Sketcher::RedundantSolving-DogLeg-

Sketcher Redundant solving: 1 redundants

    ✔ solves before geometry and preserves authored expressions
Sketcher::RedundantSolving-DogLeg-

Sketcher Redundant solving: 1 redundants

    ✔ returns authored constraint paths for conflicts
    ✔ moves an arranged cluster rigidly and resolves linked components afterward
    ✔ keeps free movement repeatable and reports it
Sketcher::RedundantSolving-DogLeg-

Sketcher Redundant solving: 0 redundants

    ✔ honors locks even when the placement requests solving

  KiCad 10
    ✔ defaults to native KiCad 10 and supports explicit selection
    ✔ preserves explicit legacy and injected templates
    ✔ normalizes routed copper and preserves numeric-looking names
    ✔ orders legacy arc coordinates for the native parser
    ✔ escapes net and board names and keeps empty nets
    ✔ normalizes zones and leaves native quoted net names intact
    ✔ rejects malformed fragments and mismatched net names
    ✔ continues to reject engine 4 configurations
    ✔ rejects unknown numeric references with board and fragment context

  Internals
    ✔ pcb outline conversion with kicad5
    ✔ pcb outline conversion with kicad8
    ✔ injection

  Interface
    ✔ debug
    ✔ formats
    ✔ preprocessor
    ✔ engine
    ✔ svg

  Guided mounting drafts

