    ✔ creates usable tray supports before CAD (2102ms)
    ✔ retains the candidate set across automatic redistribution (803ms)
    ✔ reports a manual contact in a switch opening without deleting it (392ms)

  Reusable footprint tools
    ✔ derives one envelope from all transformed cached models and keeps missing bounds unchecked
    ✔ groups electrical pads by number and leaves mechanical pads separate
    ✔ exports a standalone CommonJS module preserving geometry and mapped nets
    ✔ flips board layers, local coordinates and pad orientations on the back
    ✔ keeps unknown constructs but refuses unsafe transforms explicitly
    ✔ requires a unique target and preserves all unrelated bytes when binding models
    ✔ identifies a chosen emission independently of per-placement references
    ✔ updates multiple models on a routed board and accepts legacy single bindings
    ✔ wraps dynamic modules without changing their params, body branches or unrelated code

  Filter
    ✔ without points
    ✔ empty filter
    ✔ similar

  Solid enclosures

